Get ready for another year with us here in the sunny Algarve, the Riviera of southern Portugal!&nbsp;

\

Our 6th year in what  is known as the European Maldives. With many of the most gorgeous beaches, delicious food and adventures just waiting to happen, you do not want to miss any part of the experience. We will guide you as you learn new play and movement skills. &nbsp;Bringing you into our inner most secrets spots, our local playground and challenging you to turn up as yourself, exactly as you are, in all manner of that.\

This is a beginner and improver friendly event but our teachers and facilitators will evaluate your level at the start to adapt our content to your needs. We are meeting you where you are and then providing you with the tools to level up at your own speed.

Our inclusive retreat leaders and facilitators are hand picked for their ability to increase/expand your physical and mental ability in a safe and supportive environment while sharing their own very unique style of play. Trust me when I say we cover alllll the bases.
